    {"theme": "SpaceX files record $75B IPO", "summary": "SpaceX disclosed plans to raise $75B at a $1.77T valuation (555.6M shares at $135, all-primary), with trading expected to begin ~June 12 — would be the largest IPO in history. S&P refused to fast-track index inclusion."},
